              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Josh D"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this using Ribeyes and a 8 hour marinate, very very good, i used Kikkomans teriyaki sauce and my only regret is I wish I would have made my own as with most kikkomans products it was very salty, but the taste was great will make again for sure for the sauce I recommend this one... https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/139027/teriyaki-sauce-and-marinade/?internalSource=hub%20recipe&amp;referringContentType=Search",
            "datePublished": "2020-04-15T18:07:40.930Z"
