            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "matthewclee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Whenever I make this I make sure to marinate it for at least 48 hours. It makes the meat so tender to the point of almost falling apart. I'm a college student, so at school I don't have this luxury, but when I was home my mom asked me to make this recipe on at least 3 different occasions. I myself like to use more sugar and honey to bring out the sweetness, but overall this is an excellent recipe. So delicious.",
            "datePublished": "2010-09-23T09:45:32.910Z"
